00:33:04,302 --> 00:33:07,440
其次，透明度对 AI 系统至关重要。
Second, transparency is essential for AI systems.

337
00:33:07,790 --> 00:33:17,156
Langchain 强调可解释的决策制定并提供审计追踪，这意味着 AI 做出的决定可以被追溯和理解，
Langchain emphasizes explainable decision making and provides audit trails, which means decisions made by the AI can be traced and understood,

