00:37:04,078 --> 00:37:12,900
这些组件能让我们处理各种数据类型、管理交互，并在构建智能应用时优化流程。
These components enable us to work with various data types, manage interactions, and optimize processes when building intelligent applications.

375
00:37:13,454 --> 00:37:15,552
