01:27:41,774 --> 01:27:47,876
所以在输出中，我们可以看到智能体正确识别出查询包含两个不同的部分，
So in the output, we can see that the agent correctly recognized that the query had two distinct parts,

890
01:27:48,590 --> 01:27:50,596
