4177
06:01:19,456 --> 06:01:28,336
并且实操过ChatGPT、Claude和Gemini。这些不再仅仅是概念，而是你可以实际使用的工具。
and have worked hands on across ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini. These aren't just concepts anymore, they're tools you can actually put to use.

4178
06:01:28,576 --> 06:01:39,524
这个领域会不断发展，最好的前进方式就是持续运用你所学到的知识。运用这些技能，多做尝试，让它们成为你工作流程中自然的一部分。
The field will keep evolving, and the best way forward is to keep applying what you've learned. Use these skills, experiment often, and let them become a natural part of how you work.

